# Architecture

This document describes how the code of this project is organized. SPEC.md says what it studies.

## System Overview

[Describe the pipeline: what goes in, what each stage computes, what comes out.]

An experiment runs from its config to its figure:

```
configs/<experiment>.yaml
  -> scripts/run_<experiment>.py    (imports src/{{ project_name_snake }}/)
  -> results/<experiment>/, logs/<experiment>/run.log
  -> scripts/plot_<experiment>.py
  -> figs/<experiment>.pdf
```

