## Directory Structure

```
.
├── src/{{ project_name_snake }}/   # Importable code: models, metrics, data loading, notify.py
├── scripts/            # Entry points: run_<experiment>.py, plot_<experiment>.py, job scripts
├── configs/            # One YAML file per experiment
├── tests/              # CPU tests; tests marked gpu need a GPU, weights or the network
├── data/               # Datasets and other inputs (not in git)
├── logs/               # <experiment>/run.log, log files only (not in git)
├── results/            # <experiment>/ partial and final results, JSON/JSONL (not in git)
├── figs/               # Figures as PDF (not in git)
├── checkpoints/        # Model checkpoints, or a symlink to scratch (not in git)
├── notebooks/          # Exploration notebooks (not in git)
├── README.md           # How to install and reproduce the paper
├── SPEC.md             # Research question and experiments
├── AGENTS.md           # Rules for coding agents
├── AGENTS.local.md     # Private machine and account facts (not in git)
├── REVIEW.md           # Rules for the pr-review skill
└── .env.example        # Environment variables; copy to .env (not in git)
```

